<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Nkangala New Testament Zambia</book>
  <para style="h">Kusolola</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kusolola kuli Yiuano</para>
  <para style="toc2">Kusolola</para>
  <para style="toc3">Kus</para>
  <para style="mt1">Kusolola</para>
  <para style="mt3">Kuli Yiuano</para>
  <para style="imt">Citsindikisi</para>
  <para style="ip">Livulu lia Kusolola likelio lia mamanusuilo mu Litavasano Lialiha. Kaha naua liapuile liakumanusuila kusoneka ha miaka yakusetekesa makumi atanu na iuana na miaka itanu (95) hanima ya kusemuka ca Kilistu, valisonekele kuli Kanganda Yiuano (1:1) Kaha naua ikeye uasonekele Muzimbu Uacili ua Yiuano na mikanda itatu ya Yiuano uakulivanga, Yiuano uamucivali, na Yiuano ua mucitatu. Yiuano ikeye naua uje ivazivukile nguavo, “Uje yazangele Yesu.” (Yiuano 13:23) Uasonekele livulu eli lia Kusolola tele ali ha nkundu ya Patimose muomu hakeho havamutualele ku vunzinda ha mulonga ua kuambulula Muzimbu Uacili ua Yesu Kilistu (Kusolola 1:9) Visinganieka via Yiuano hakusoneka livulu lia Kusolola viapuile kusimpisa vaka kutanda linga vakale mu kulongua kuli Yesu Kilistu na kuvahana kutsiliela muomu kuhiluka ca Yesu cili muyehi (1:3; 22:7) Uasonekelele kuli voshe vaka Kilistu na ku vikungulukilo lika vije vitanu na vivali mu kapetulu (2; 3) Yiuano atumbula visoneka viendi kupua via vunanguizi (1:3) kaha alikuasesa vifua viavingi mu livulu lioshe kulumbununa viuma vije viamuene. Livulu eli linalifu na mitambela imo ya mu Litavasano Lialaja, cikuma kuma hali Zakaliya 6:1-8 Matolombita atanu na avali na malonga atanu na avali na vikevio vinalifu na tuyando tuakama tuje tuatumine Njambi mukuhana kashitiko vaka Ingito (Ezundu 7; 9) Livulu lia Kusolola lihandeka ha ntsimbu ya kumanusuila, ngeci Yesu akahiana, kaha voshe vaje vakahaka kutsiliela cavo muli ikeye vakayoya ya yaye nendi. Eceleni eli livulu liminangule nakumihana kutsiliela ngeci Yesu ali nakuhiluka vuasi vuasi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Muvana vitumbikilamo</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Yiuano aputuka ku lihandeka ikeye vavenia na muje muatambuile eci cimona ca vunanguizi (1:1; 1:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Ahana muzimbu kuhuminina kuli Yesu nakuutuala ku vikungulukilo vitanu na vivali (1:1; 3:22)</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Ambahoni alumbununa tusateso tutanu na tuvali (4:1; 8:5) na matolombita atanu na avali (8:6; 11:19)</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Hanima yeci Yiuano alumbununa muana ua yala hakuluisa canza ngombe uje ali na mitue itanu na ivali (12:1; 14:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">5. Kaha asoneka ha malonga atanu na avali a vutenu (15:1; 16:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">6. Cakuhatako Yiuano alumbununa muje Njambi ahiana vitozi vendi muilu (17:1; 20:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">7. Cakumanusuila alumbununa lilu lia liha na mavu a maha vije vikeja ku mamanusuilo (21:1; 22:21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Kusholola ca Yesu Kilistu cije camuhanene Njambi linga amuese vangamba vendi hali vije vikalingiua vuavuno. Uazivukisile eci hakutuma kangelo uendi kuli ngamba yendi Yiuano, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />uje uambuluile vioshe vije viamuene vije viapuile lizi lia Njambi na vukaleho vua Yesu Kilistu. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Uakukuisula uje atanda mukutambeka mezi a vunanguizi, kaha naua vakukuisula vaje vevua nakutulika vije vivana sonekamo muomu ntsimbu ili muyehi.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vihindu ku vikungulukilo vitanu na vivali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Yange Yiuano njisonekela ku vikungulukilo vitanu na vivali via mu nganda ya Asiya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Kavumbi na ciyulo kuli yeni vije vihuma kuli uje aliko, uje uakeleko naua ikeye akeja, naua vihindu vieni vije vinahumu ku Vimbembesi vitanu na vivali vije viakala ku litanda liendi, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />na kuli Yesu Kilistu, mukaleho uakulongua uje ntuatua uavaka kusanguka ku vatsi kaha naua ikeye muka kuyula ua vimiene va ha mavu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Kuli ikeye uje uatuzanga naua uatupatuile ku vipi vietu na maninga endi, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />nakutupuisa vumuene, na vasasendote kuli Njambi yendi na Tate, kuli ikeye kukale vumpau na kuyula ca yaye! Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Taleni, alinakuija mu mashelua! Muntu na muntu uoshe akamumona cipue vene uje uamutuvile likunga akamumona. Miyati yoshe ha mavu vakalila muomu yendi. Omu mukemuo mucikafua! Ameni!<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />“Yange Alufa na Omenga,” muanahandeka Muene Njambi, “uje aliko, ikeye uakeleko, naua ikeye akeja, Uanzili yoshe.”<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cimona ca Kilistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Yange Yiuano, muanoko uje imulina kulipangela nendi mapakeso muli Yesu na vumuene na tuyando tuje tulinakuija tutuli nakuvandamena. Vanjihakele mu nkundu ya Patimose muomu ya lizi lia Njambi na vukaleho vua Yesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Njakele mu Cimbembesi ha litangua lia Muene, kaha njovuile lizi kunima yange lije liatambekele ngue tolombita <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />ngualio “Soneka mu livulu vije viumona kaha litume ku vikungulukilo vitanu na vivali, vikevio via mu Efeso na Simina na Pelengamu na Tiyatila na Salendisiya na Filandelufiya na Laondisiya.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Ambahoni njatengulukile linga njimone lizi lieya lije liahandekele kuli yange, kaha omo njatengulukile njamuene vitumbiko via vindeya via ngolinde vitanu na vivali, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />kaha hakati ka vitumbiko via vindeya njamuenemo umo uakulifua ngue Muna Muntu, uje uazalele kazaku kalaha na muiva ua ngolinde uazengeleka mu ntulo yendi. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Vinkambu via ku mutue uendi viatokele too ngue vuanda vua kutoka, naua ngue mpemba, na mesho endi afuile ngue mulengi ua tuhia, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />viliato viendi viafuile ngue vunengu vuakukuita mufuitilo na lizi liendi liapuile ngue cikukuta ca mema amengi. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Mu livoko liendi lia cilio uakuatele vintanga ntanga vitanu na vivali, na mu kanua kendi muahumine mukuale uavutuesi kuvali. Kaha na cihanga cendi caviakumine ngue misha ya litangua lili hakati ka mutue. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Omo njamumuene, njauililile ku viliato viendi ngue muntu natsi. Vuno honi uanjisalekele livoko liendi lia cilio nakuhandeka nguendi, “Keti uvue liova! Yange Uakuputukila na Kumanusuila. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Kaha yange uakuyoya! Njatsile, kaha honi tala, njilina kuyoya miaka yoshe ya yaye. Yange njakuata masapi a kutsa na Vukalo vua vatsi. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Kaha honi soneka viuma vije vi unamono, na vije viliko, na vije vikakalako hanima yevi. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Ngue ku cisinkiko ca vintanga ntanga vitanu na vivali vije viuamuene mu livoko liange lia cilio, na vije vitumbiko via vindeya via ngolinde vitanu na vivali: vije vintanga ntanga vitanu na vivali vinapu tungelo va kuje ku vikungulukilo vitanu na vivali, kaha na vije vitumbiko via vindeya via ngolinde vitanu na vivali vinapu vije vikungulukilo vitanu na vivali.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Mukanda ku cikungulukilo ca mu Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Sonekela kuli kangelo uaku cikungulukilo ca mu Efeso nguove,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">“Aua akeuo mezi endi uje uakuata vintanga ntanga vitanu na vivali mu livoko liendi lia cilio, uje akende hakati ka vitumbiko via vindeya via ngolinde vitanu na vivali. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Njazivuka vipangi vieni, muje mumuli nakupangela na nzili yoshe na kuvandamena ceni. Njazivuka nguange kumuasa kupangela hamo na vaka kulinga vupi, kaha muneseka vaje valitumbula nguavo vakevo tunganda vuno honi houe, kaha munauana nguavo vakevo vaka makuli. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Kaha naua njazivuka nguange muli nakuvandamena mukusimpa na kumona tuyando muomu ya lizina liange, kaha kumuahonene. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Vuno honi njili neci cimiluisa, munecela cije cizango cimuakele naco ha kulivanga. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Vulukeni kuli vije vinamiuisa. Tengulukeni ku vipi vieni kaha lingeni vipangi vije mualingile ha kulivanga. Nga keti ngoco kaha njikeja kuli yeni nakuhumisa vitumbiko via vindeya vieni mu vihela viavio. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Vuno honi vucili vueni ovu, muazinda vipangi via vantu vaje vakakava Nikolau, vije nange naua vinjazinda.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />“Eceleni uoshe uje ali na matuitui linga evuilile kuli vije Cimbembesi ali nakuhandeka ku vikungulukilo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">“Kaha kuli uoshe uje muka kuhiana, njikamuhana kapandi kakulia ku muti ua muono uje uli mu Palandaisi ya Njambi.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukanda ku cikungulukilo ca mu Simina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Sonekela kuli kangelo uaku cikungulukilo ca mu Simina nguove,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">“Aua akeuo mezi a uje Uakuputukila na Kumanusuila, uje uatsile kaha uakele na muono naua. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Njazivuka mapakeso na kuhutua ceni, cipue vene munafuku. Njazivuka kushaula kuje vali nakumishaula vaje vahandeka nguavo vakevo vapua Vayunda vuno honi houe, vapua njivo ya malombelo ya Satana. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Keti muvue liova lia tuyando tuje tuli nakuija. Taleni, Liyavolo akahaka vamo veni mu kamenga mukumieseka, kaha mukakala mu mapakeso ha matangua akupua likumi. Pueni vakulongua cipue vene naku ku kutsa, kaha njikamihana cilongo ca muono.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />“Uoshe uje ali namatuitui evuilile kuli vije Cimbembesi ali nakuhandeka ku vikungulukilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">“Uoshe uje akahiana kakavulumuka ku kutsa ca mucivali.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukanda ku cikungulukilo ca mu Pelengamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Sonekela kuli kangelo uaku cikungulukilo ca mu Pelengamu nguove,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">“Aua akeuo mezi auje ali na mukuale uavutuesi kuvali. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Njazivuka kuje kumuakala, kuje kuakala litanda lia Satana. Vuno honi hanga muli na lukakateya ku lizina liange, kaha kumuavianene lutsilielo lueni muli yange cipue vene mu matangua a Antipase mukaleho uange uakulongua uje ivatsihile hakati keni, kuje kuakala Satana. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Vuno honi njilina viavindende viakumiluisa navio, muli na vamo kuje vaje vakakateya ku vilongesa via Mbalame, uje ualongesele Mbalake linga ahake citsuntsuiso ku vantu Vaisaleli linga valie viakulia vije vivana kombelela ku tumponia na kulinga vupangala. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Neni naua muli navamo vaje vanakakateya ku vilongesa via vaka Nikolau. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Nankuma, tengulukeni ku vipi vieni! Nga houe, kaha njija vuavuno kuli yeni nakulinga navo nzita ya mukuale ua mu kanua kange.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />“Uoshe uje ali na matuitui evuilile vije Cimbembesi alinakuhandeka ku vikungulukilo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">“Kuli uoshe uje akahiana njikamuhana maana yavushueka, na livue lia kutoka kaha ha livue lia kutoka vanasonekaho lizina lia liha lije naumo uahi alizivuka kuvanga lika uje alitambula.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukanda ku cikungulukilo ca mu Tiyatila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Sonekela kuli kangelo uaku cikungulukilo ca mu Tiyatila nguove,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">“Aua akeuo mezi a Muna Njambi, uje uakala na mesho ngue mulengi ua tuhia, uje viliato viendi viafua ngue vunengu vuakukuita mufuitilo. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Njazivuka vipangi vieni, na cizango ceni na lutsilielo lueni, na vukuasi vueni na kuvandamena ceni calukakateya. Njazivuka nguange vipangi vieni via kumanusuila vinapu viakama kupulakana viakulivanga. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Vuno honi njili nevi viakumiluisa navio, munecelela uje mpuevo Njezevele, uje akalitumbula ikeye vavenia nguendi kananguizi uampuevo, akatanganesa vangamba vange na vilongesa viendi linga valinge vukoyi na kulia viakulia via kukombelela ku tumponia. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Njamuhanene ntsimbu linga atenguluke ku vipi viendi, vuno honi naviana kutenguluka ku vilinga viendi via vukoyi. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Taleni, njimumbila ha muhela ua tuyando hamo na vaje vakalingi nendi vupangala, njikavombila mu mapakeso akama kuvanga noho vaka tenguluka ku vilinga viendi. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Njikatsiha vana vendi, kaha vikungulukilo vioshe vikazivuka nguavo yange uje njikatondo mana na mutima, kaha njikahana vuana ku muntu na muntu kuya ku vipangi viendi.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />“Vuno honi kuli yeni munasalaho mu Tayatila, yeni vaje kuvakakateya ku vilongesa evi, vaje ku valilongesele vije vivatumbula vamo nguavo, ‘Viuma viakulova via Satana.’ Kaha kuli yeni njihandeka nguange kunjikaneha citeli ceka naua. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Kakateyeni lika kuli vije mulinavio noho njikeja. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Kuli uoshe uje ahiana na kutualelelaho kupanga vipangi viange na kuntsongo, njikamuhana nzili yakama ha mafuti, <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />kaha aka vayula na mbueti ya cikuvo kaha vaka saniozoka ngue muje ndeho ya vuma muikatavuka, ngue muje yange njatambuile nzili yakama kuli Tate, <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />kaha njikamuhana ntanga ntanga ya cimene.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />“Uoshe uje ali na matuitui evuilile kuli vije Cimbembesi alina kuhandeka ku vikungulukilo.<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Mukanda ku cikungulukilo ca mu Salandesiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Sonekela kuli kangelo uaku cikungulukilo ca mu Salandesiya nguove,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">“Aua akeuo mezi a uje ali na vimbembesi vitanu na vivali via Njambi na vintanga ntanga vitanu na vivali. Njazivuka vipangi vieni, vakahandeka nguavo uyoya vuno honi unatsi. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Hinduka kaha kolesa vije vinasalako vije vili muyehi nakutsa. Muomu njinauana vipangi viove kuvia lumbunukile ku mesho a Njambi yange. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Nankuma, vuluka vije viuatambuile na vije viuevuile, vitulike kaha tenguluka ku vipi viove. Nga shove kuhinduka njikeja ngue muizi, kaha ku ukazivuka cipue ntsimbu muka njikeja kuli yove. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Vuno honi hanga mucili na vantu vavandende mu Salandesiya, vaje kuvahakele mpumputa ku vuzalo vuavo, kaha vakenda hamo nange mukutoka, muomu cavapande. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Kuli uje akahiana, akavazika vuzalo vuje vuakutoka, kaha kunjikahumisa lizina liendi mu livulu lia muono. Njikahandeka lizina liendi ku mesho a Tate naku mesho a tungelo vendi.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />“Uje uoshe ali na matuitui evuilile vije Cimbembesi ali nakuhandeka ku vikungulukilo!<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukanda ku cikungulukilo ca mu Filandelufiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Sonekela kuli kangelo uaku cikungulukilo ca mu Filandelufiya nguove,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">“Aua akeuo mezi a uje umo Uakulela uje ua Vusunga. Uje ali na sapi ya Ndaviti, kaha vije ashokolola naumo uahi asa kuvishoka, na vije ashoka naumo uahi asa kuvishokolola. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Njazivuka vipangi vieni, tala njinashokolola cikolo kulutue luove, cije naumo uahi asa kucishoka. Njazivuka nguange uli na nzili yaindende, vuno honi hanga unatulika lizi liange kaha ku uavianene lizina liange. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Tala njikapuisa vaje vaka njivo ya malombelo ya Satana vaje vakahandeka nguavo vakevo vapua Vayunda vuno honi houe vapua lika vaka makuli, tala, njikavalinga ngeci vakeje na kutsikama ku viliato viove. Voshe vakazivuka ngeci nkuma njakuzanga. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Muomu unaniungu lizi liange nakusimpa calukakateya, kaha njikakuniunga ha ntsimbu ya vieseko vije vilinakuija ha mavu oshe, vije vija nakueseka vaje voshe vakala ha mavu. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Njilinakuija vuasi vuasi. Kaha kakateya kuli vije ulinavio, linga keti kukale umo akunieke cilongo cove. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Uoshe uje akahiana njikamupuisa cisimi ca seho mu njivo ya Njambi yange, kaha ka katuhukamo naua. Njikasoneka hali ikeye lizina lia Njambi yange na lizina lia nganda ya Njambi yange, Yelusalema yaiha ije ihuma kuli Njambi yange muilu kaha naua njikasoneka hali ikeye lizina liange lia liha.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />“Uoshe uje alina matuitui evuilile vika vije Cimbembesi ali nakuhandeka ku vikungulukilo!<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukanda ku cikungulukilo ca mu Laondisiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Sonekela kuli kangelo uaku cikungulukilo ca mu Laondisiya nguove,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">“Aua akeo mezi a Ameni, mukaleho uakulongua na vusunga, maputukilo a viakutanga via Njambi. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Njizivuka vipangi viove, keti u uakutontola cipue u uakuyukuma. Njatondele tele ngue ku uapuile u uakutontola cipue u uakuyukuma! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Nankuma muomu u uanguinie nguinie, keti u uakutontola cipue u uakuyukuma, kaha njikakujekula mukanua kange! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Ukahandeka nguove, ‘Njinafuku, njilina vufuko vuoshe, kaha nacimo njitonda cahi.’ Vuno honi ku uzivuka nguove umuka kuyanda, uivuisa ngozi, ucihutu, ukapuputua, naua ku uazalele vuzalo. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Nankuma njikunangula linga ulande ngolinde ya kuyengulula mu tuhia kuli yange, linga ufuke. Landa vuzalo vua kutoka uzale linga shuamua yakuhona vuzalo vuove keti imoneke. Landa na vihemba uhake mu mesho ove linga umone. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Kuli vaje voshe njazanga, njivindika na kuzangamesa. Kaha kaleni nantuima na kutenguluka ku vipi vieni. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Tala! Njinemana ku cikolo na kutota, nga kuli umo evua lizi liange na kushokolola cikolo, njikakovela na kulia nendi, kaha nendi naua akalia nange. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Uoshe uje akahiana, njikamuhana kapandi kakutumama nange ha litanda liange, ngue muje yange njahianene kaha njatumamene na Tate ha litanda liendi.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />“Uoshe uje alina matuitui ovue vije Cimbembesi alina kuhandeka ku vikungulukilo!”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Kulemesa ca Muilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Munima yevi njatalele, kaha njamuene cikolo cakushokoloka muilu. Kaha lizi lije linjovuile ha kulivanga lije liahandekele kuli yange ngue tolombita liahandekele ngualio, “Ija kuno, kaha njikakumuesa vije vinahatako munima yevi.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Ha ntsimbu imo njakele mu Cimbembesi, kaha njamuene litanda muilu na uje uatumameneho. <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Kaha uje uatumameneho uasholokele ngue mavue aseho a njasipa na kanelia, kaha ku litanda kuazengulukile nkongolo ije yasholokele ngue mavue a emalinde. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kuakele matanda makumi avali na auana aje azengelekele lije litanda, haje ha matanda hatumamene vakuluntu vakupua makumi avali na vauana vaje vazalele tuzaku tuakutoka na vilongo via ngolinde ku mitue yavo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Ha litanda hahumine vihiatulo via muhiato, na cililimo na kuluma. Kaha halutue lua litanda hakele nakushukuma milengi ya tuhia itanu na ivali, eyi yapuile vimbembesi vitanu na vivali via Njambi. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Kaha naua kulutue lua litanda kuakele cije casholokele ngue cisali cakulifua ngue kalivangelo ka kutungukua ka livue lia kilisitale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Ku mutambela umo na umo ua litanda kuazengelekele tusitu vakuyoya vauana vaje vakele na mesho kulutue na kunima. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Kasitu uakuyoya uakulivanga uafuile ngue ndumba, uamucivali uafuile ngue ngombe uankomba, uamucitatu uakele na cihanga ngue ca muntu, na uamuciuana uafuile ngue ngonga uakupululuka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Kaha umo na umo uavaje tusitu vakuyoya uakele na mambava atanu na limo aje akele na mesho kuoshe na mukati. Vutsiki na mutania vakele nakuimba nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">“Uakulela, uakulela, uakulela ikeye Muene Njambi Muka nzili yoshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">uje uakeleko, uje aliko, ikeye uje akeja.”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Ntsimbu yoshe vaje tusitu vakuyoya vakahana vumpau, na kasingimiko, na kutsantsela kuli ikeye uje uatumama ha litanda, uje uayoya ya yaye. <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />Vaje makumi avali na vauana a vakuluntu vakatsikama kuli uje uatumama ha litanda na kumulemesa ikeye uje uayoya ya yaye. Vakahaka vilongo viavo ha mavu kulutue lia litanda nakuimba nguavo,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“Muene uetu na Njambi yetu, yove uafuila kutambula vumpau na kasingimiko na nzili.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">Muomu yove uatangele viuma vioshe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">kaha ha cizango cove vavitangele na kukalako.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Livulu liakuzenga na Muna Mpanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Kaha njamuene mu livoko lia cilio lia uje uatumamene ha litanda livulu liakuzenga lije liakusoneka helu na mukati, valipatele na tusateso tutanu na tuvali. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Kaha njamuene kangelo ua nzili yoshe uje uahandekele na lizi lia kutambeka nguendi, “Nkuma iya nafuila kushokolola otu tusateso tua livulu liakuzenga eli na kulifukula?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Naumo uahi muilu cipue ha mavu cipue muintsi lia mavu uasele kushokolola lije livulu liakuzenga cipue kulitala mukati kalio. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Njalilile cikuma muomu naumo uahi uafuililile kushokolola lije livulu liakuzenga cipue kulitala mukati kalio. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Ambahoni umo ua vakuluntu uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Keti ulile. Tala! Ndumba uaku muyati ua Yunda, Muzi ua Ndaviti nahiana, kaha asa kushokolola eli livulu lia kuzenga na tusateso tualio tutanu na tuvali.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Kaha mukati ka litanda na tusitu vakuyoya vauana na hakati ka vakuluntu. Njamuene Muna Mpanga nemana oku ngue vanamutsihi, uakele na mambinga atanu na avali na mesho atanu na avali, akeuo aje vimbembesi vitanu na vivali via Njambi vije vianatumu ha mavu oshe. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Uje Muna Mpanga uayile nakuambata lije livulu liakuzenga ku livoko lia cilio lia uje uatumamene ha litanda. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Omo uambatele lije livulu liakuzenga, kaha vaje tusitu vakuyoya vauana na vakuluntu makumi avali na vauana vauililile ku viliato via Muna Mpanga. Umo na umo uakele na kalialia na malonga a ngolinde aje ashulile na ngongosi ya luengo luacili, evi vikevio malombelo a vantu va Njambi vakulela. <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Vembile muaso uauha nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Yove uafuila kuambata eli livulu lia kuzenga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">nakushokolola tusateso tualio.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Muomu yove vakutsihile, kaha na maninga ove ualandele vantu kuli Njambi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">kuhuma ku muyati, naku ndaka, naku vantu na cifuti.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Kaha uavapuisa vumuene na vasasendote kuli Njambi yetu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:10">kaha vakayula ha mavu.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Ambahoni njatalele, kaha njovuile mezi a tungelo vavengi, makulukazi ha makulukazi, na makumi a makulukazi ha makumi a makulukazi. Vazengelekele litanda, na tusitu vakuyoya na vakuluntu, <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />vahandekele na lizi liakutambeka nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Nafuila ou Muna Mpanga ivatsihile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">kutambula nzili, na vufuko, na mana, na nzili yoshe, na kasingimiko, na vumpau na vikuisulo!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Kaha njovuile viakutanga vioshe muilu, na hano ha mavu, na muintsi lia mavu, na mu cisali, na vioshe vije vilimo, viahandekele nguavio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Kuli uje uatumama ha litanda na kuli Muna Mpanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">kukale vikuisulo, na kasingimiko, na vumpau, na nzili yoshe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">ku miaka yoshe ya yaye!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Kaha tusitu vakuyoya vauana vahandekele nguavo, “Ameni!” Kaha vakuluntu vauililile ha mavu na kulemesa.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Tusateso tutanu na tuvali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Kaha honi njamuene omo Muna Mpanga uashokoluele cimo ca tuje tusateso tutanu na tuvali, kaha njovuile umo ua tusitu vauana vakuyoya uahandekele na lizi lia kutambeka ngue cililimo nguendi, “Ija!” <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Taleni! Njamuene kavalu ua kutoka. Uje ualondeleho uakele na vuta vua lungusa, kaha vamuhanene cilongo, kaha uayile ngue muka kuhiana mukuhiana.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Omo uashokoluele kasateso kamucivali, njovuile uamucivali ku tusitu vakuyoya ahandeka nguendi, “Ija!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Kaha kuezile naua mukuavo kavalu, uje uapuile uakuvenga ngeengu. Uje ualondeleho vamuhanene nzili yakuhumisa ciyulo ha mavu, linga vantu valitsihe umo na mukuavo. Vamuhanene mukuale uakama.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Omo uje Muna Mpanga uashokoluele kasateso ka mucitatu, njovuile uamucitatu ku tusitu vakuyoya ahandeka nguendi, “Ija!” Kaha taleni, njamuene kavalu uakuzivala. Uje ualondeleho uakele na cipeseleso mu livoko liendi. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Kaha njovuile vije vialifuile ngue lizi hakati ka tusitu vakuyoya vauana lije liahandekele ngualio, “Lita ya tiliku inapu ngue fueto ya ha litangua, kaha malita atatu a mbale anapu fueto ya litangua. Vuno honi keti upihise mazi na viniu!”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Omo Muna Mpanga uashokoluele kasateso ka muciuana, njovuile lizi lia ua muciuana ku tusitu vakuyoya lihandeka ngualio, “Ija!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Kaha taleni, njamuene kavalu uakutokoloka. Kaha lizina lia uje ualondeleho liapuile Kutsa, kaha na Vukalo vua vatsi vuamukavele. Vavahanene nzili ha mutambela umo ua mitambela iuana ya mavu, mukutsiha na mukuale, na njala yakama, na mishongo na vikashama va ha mavu.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Kaha omo uashokoluele kasateso ka mucitanu, muintsi lia mutula njamuene miono ya vaje vavatsihile muomu ya lizi lia Njambi na vukaleho vuje vuvatambuile. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Valilile kutambakana nguavo, “Muene Uanzili yoshe, uakulela na vusunga, nkuma ntsimbu muka honi ukasompa na kutonda maninga etu hali vaje vatutsihile ha mavu?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Ambahoni umo na umo uavo vamuhanene kazaku kakutoka nakuvaleka nguavo linga vahuimeko lika kantsimbu noho vakuavo vangamba na vavushoko vavo vanahu, vaje vavatondele kutsiha ngue muvatsihile vakevo.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Omo Muna Mpanga uashokoluele kasateso ka mucitanu na kamo, njatalele, kaha taleni njamuene lindunduma liakama na litangua liazivalele ngue cikeleya cakuzivala, kaha na ngonde yoshe yavengele ngue maninga. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Kaha vintanga ntanga via muilu viauililile ha mavu, ngue muti ua mukuyu mu ukakukumuna vushuka vuauo vua mucisika omo vauningangesa ku mpunzi yakama. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Lilu liahumine ngue livulu liakuzenga lije livalinakuzenga, na minkinda yoshe na vinkundu va vihumisile mu mitambela yavio. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Ambahoni vimiene vahano ha mavu, na vaka kusuana, na vakuluntu va nzita, na vaka kufuka, na vakukolesa, na muntu uoshe, ndungo na muka kupatuka, valishuekele mu mena akucokola mu mavue na ku mavue akama aha minkinda. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Vahandekele ku minkinda na mavue akama nguavo, “Tuuileni na kutushueka ku cihanga cendi uje natumama ha litanda na ku vutenu vua Muna Mpanga! <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />Muomu litangua liakama lia vutenu vuavio lineja, nkuma iya asa kuimana?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Vantu Vaisaleli vakupua 144,000 vaje vavahakele Tusateso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Munima yevi njamuene tungelo vauana vanemana mu vimbango viuana via mavu, vakele nakuimika mpunzi mu vimbango viuana via mavu linga naimo yahi ipekumuke ha mavu, cipue ha cisali, cipue ku muti uoshe. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Ambahoni njamuene kangelo ashuluka kuhuma ku vutuhukilo vua litangua na kasateso ka Njambi ua kuyoya. Uasanene tungelo vauana vaje vavahanene nzili yakupihisa mavu na cisali na lizi liakutambeka nguendi, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />“Keti mupihise mavu, cipue cisali, cipue miti, kuvanga noho tuahaka kasateso ha maholo a vangamba va Njambi yetu.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Kaha njovuile numelu ya vantu vaje vavahakele tusateso yapuile 144,000 kuhuminina ku miyati yoshe ya vana Vaisaleli. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Vakupua 12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Yunda vavahakele tusateso, 12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Luvena, 12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Ngande, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Ashele, 12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Nafetali, 12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Manase, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Simione, 12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Levi, 12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Isakale, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Zembuloni, 12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Yosefa, na 12,000 kuhuminina ku muyati ua Mbenjemani.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Civunga cakama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Munima yevi njatalele, kaha taleni, njamuene civunga cakama cije naumo uahi asa kucitanda, kuhuminina ku mafuti oshe, na ku miyati yoshe, na ku vantu voshe naku vindaka vioshe vemanene kulutue lua litanda na kulutue lua Muna Mpanga. Vazalele tuzaku tuakutoka, kaha vambatele mintango ya mambale mu mavoko avo. <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />Valilile mukutambeka nguavo, “Kuovoka cakala kuli Njambi yetu uje uatumama ha litanda, na kuli Muna Mpanga!” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Kaha tungelo voshe vemanene na kuzengeleka litanda na vakuluntu na tusitu vakuyoya vauana. Va vulumanene kulutue lua litanda nakulemesa Njambi, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />vahandekele nguavo, “Ameni! Vikuisulo, na vumpau, na mana, na citsantselo, na kasingimiko, na nzili na nzili yoshe vikale kuli Njambi yetu ku miaka yoshe ya yaye! Ameni!”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Ambahoni umo ua vakuluntu uanjihuile nguendi, “Veya ava vanazala tuzaku tuakutoka, nkuma vahuminina kuli?”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Njamukumbuluile nguange, “Uazivuka Muene.” Kaha uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Ava vakevo vanahumu mu mapakeso akama. Vanakushu tuzaku tuavo na kututokesa mu maninga a Muna Mpanga. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Nankuma vali kulutue lia litanda lia Njambi, na kumupangela mutania na vutsiki mu Njivo ya Njambi. Kaha uje uatumama ha litanda akavaniunga nakukala cendi. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Kuvakatsiho naua njala, cipue kuivua mpuila naua, mutania ku ukavatuilaho, cipue mpunzi ya ntuima kuikavatuila, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />muomu Muna Mpanga uje ali hakati ka litanda ikeye akapua kaniungi kavo, kaha akavatuamenena ku livuelu vuelu lia mema a muono. Kaha Njambi akahunda masozi oshe ku mesho avo.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Kasateso ka mucitanu na tuvali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Omo uje Muna Mpanga uashokoluele kasateso ka mucitanu na tuvali, muilu muaholokele kuluu ha mutambela umo ua ola. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Ambahoni njamuene tungelo vatanu na vavali vaje vakakuimana kulutue lua Njambi, kaha vavahanene vitolombita vitanu na vivali.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Kangelo mukuavo uezile nakuimana ku mutula na lilonga lia ngolinde lia ngongosi ya luengo luacili. Kaha vamuhanene ngongosi ya luengo luacili yaingi ngeci alambuile hamo na malombelo a vantu va kulela va Njambi voshe ha mutula ua ngolinde kulutue lua litanda. <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />Vuisi vua ngongosi ya luengo luacili na malombelo a vakakulela vua kakumukile kuhuma mu livoko lia kangelo halutue lua Njambi. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ambahoni kangelo uambatele lije lilonga lia ngolinde lia ngongosi ya luengo luacili na kulishulisa na manungu a tuhia a ha mutula, kaha ualiumbilile ha mavu. Kaha kuakele kumbalanganda kua cililimo, na mezi, na milengi ya mihiato na mandunduma.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matolombita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Honi vaje tungelo vatanu na vavali vaje vakele na matolombita atanu na avali valivuaheselele linga va asike.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Kangelo uakulivanga uasikile tolombita yendi. Kaha kuanokele kalunga ua civue na tuhia vije via litsinganesele na maninga viauililile ha mavu. Kaha mavu a mucitatu auemene na mutambela ua mucitatu ua miti uauemene, kaha na muila uoshe ua vuntsompo uauemene.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Kaha kangelo ua mucivali uasikile tolombita yendi. Kaha vimo viakulifua ngue munkinda uakama oku u uema na tuhia va viumbilile mu cisali, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />kaha mutambela uamucitatu ua cisali uempukile maninga. Kaha mutambela uamucitatu ua tusitu vakuyoya mu cisali vatsile, na mutambela ua mucitatu ua mato uanongele.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Kangelo ua mucitatu uasikile tolombita yendi. Kaha ntanga ntanga yakama ya kuviakuma ngue mutetengo yauile kuhuma muilu, kaha yauililile ha mutambela ua mucitatu ua vindonga na ha mavuelu vuelu a mema. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Lizina lia ije ntanga ntanga liapuile Kushasha. Mema a mucitatu empukile Kushasha, kaha vantu vavengi vaje vanuine mema aje, vatsile muomu ashashele.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Kangelo uamu ciuana uasikile tolombita yendi. Kaha mutambela ua mucitatu ua litangua, na mutambela ua mucitatu ua ngonde, na mutambela ua mucitatu ua vintanga ntanga vavipupile linga mutambela ua mucitatu ua ceke cavio uzivale, mutambela ua mucitatu ua mutania kuuatuile muacili ceke, mucifua cimovene na mutambela ua mucitatu ua vutsiki kuuatuile muacili ceke.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Ambahoni njatalele, kaha njovuile ngonga uje uakele nakupululuka oku ohia ha vukambuila nguendi, “Kayando! Kayando! Kayando kakama kuli vaje vakala hano ha mavu, muomu yakuohia ca matolombita vikuavo vije tungelo vatatu vakemba.”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Kangelo ua mucitanu uasikile tolombita yendi, kaha njamuene ntanga ntanga kuhuminina muilu nakuuila ha mavu, kaha vamuhanene sapi ya cina cakuhona masima. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Kaha uashokoluele cina ca kuhona masima, kaha ku cina kuahumine vuisi vuakulifua ngue vuisi vua ha lihando, kaha litangua na mpunzi va vizivalesele ku vuisi vuje vuahumine muje mu cina cakuhona masima. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Ambahoni muje mu vuisi muahumine vambimba nakuija hano ha mavu, kaha navakevo vavahanene nzili imo ngue ya manieue vaha mavu. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Vavalekele nguavo keti vakapihise muila ua ha mavu cipue cuma coshe ca vuntsompo ca kusoka cipue muti, vuno honi lika vantu vaje kuvesi na kasateso ka Njambi ha maholo avo. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Vaje vambimba vavatavesele kuyandesa vaje vantu ha vingonde vitanu, vuno honi kuvavatavesele ku vatsiha. Kaha kayando kavo kavavalele cikuma ngue vusungu vua linieue omo nga natuvu muntu. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Mu matangua aje vantu vakasetela kutsa vuno honi kuvakaciuana, vakatonda kutsa, kaha kutsa cikateua kuli vakevo.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Vaje vambimba vasholokele ngue tuvalu vaje vanalivuahesela kulua, ha mitue yavo hakele vimo viakulifua ngue vilongo via ngolinde, na vihanga viavo viafuile ngue vihanga via vantu. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Vinkambu viavo viafuile ngue vinkambu via vampuevo, kaha na mazo avo afuile ngue mazo a ndumba. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Mivila yavo vayifuikile na mavanda akulifua ngue vintelo via vikuvo, kaha na cililimo ca mambava avo cafuile ngue kalua ka tuvalu vavengi vaje vashatuka na matemba kuya ku nzita. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Vakele na mikila ya mambimbo ngue a manieue, kaha ku mikila yavo kukeko kuakala nzili ya kuvulumuna vantu ha vingonde vitanu. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Vali na muene hakati kavo ikeye kangelo ua cina cakuhona masima. Lizina liendi mu Cihevelu ikeye Ambandoni, kaha mu Cingelengu ikeye vamutumbula nguavo Apolioni (kulumbuna ngeci ikeye Muka kupihisa)<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Kayando kakulivanga kanahiti, kaha taleni tuyando tuvali tukuavo naua tucilinakuija hanima yevi viuma.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Ambahoni kangelo ua mucitanu na umo uasikile tolombita yendi, kaha njovuile lizi kuhuminina ku mambinga auana a mutula ua ngolinde kulutue lua Njambi. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />Lije lizi liahandekele kuli uje kangelo ua mucitanu na umo uje uakele na tolombita ngualio, “Zitula tungelo vauana vaje vavanakutu kuje ku ndonga yakama ya Yufuleti.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Nankuma vaje tungelo vauana vavazituile, vaje vavavuahesele laja ha ntsimbu ino vene, na litangua lino, na ngonde ino na ku muaka uno mukutsiha mutambela ua mucitatu ua vantu. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Vuingi vua masualale va ha tuvalu vaku kavali vapuile 200,000,000. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Kaha omu mukemuo munjamuene vaje tuvalu mu cimona cange: kaha vaje valondeleho vazalele vintelo via muyati uakulifua ngue tuhia na safile, na sulufa. Kaha na mitue ya vaje tuvalu yafuile ngue mitue ya vandumba, kaha na mutunua tuavo muahumine tuhia na vuisi na sulufa. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Kaha tuyando tuakama tutatu tuje tuahumine mutunua tuavo tua tuhia, vuisi na sulufa tuatsihile mutambela ua mucitatu ua vantu. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Muomu nzili ya tuvalu yakala mutunua tuavo naku mikila yavo. Mikila yavo yafua ngue manoka vali na mitue, kaha ikeyo ivakalikuasesa mukuvulumuna. <verse eid="REV 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Vantu voshe vaje vasaleleho, vaje kuvatsile ku tuyando otu tuakama, ku vatengulukile ku vipangi via vipi cipue kulikela kulemesa mahamba na tumponia tua ngolinde, na siliva, na vunengu, na mavue na viti vije kuviasa kumona, cipue kuvua cipue kuenda. <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />Naua ku vatengulukile ku kutsihia cavo, cipue ku mantseno avo, cipue ku vukoyi vuavo, cipue ku vuizi vuavo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Kangelo na livulu liakuzenga lia lindende</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ambahoni njamuene naua kangelo mukuavo ua nzili uje uahumine muilu. Uazalele lishelua kaha uakele na nkongolo ha mutue uendi, na cihanga cendi cafuile ngue litangua, kaha na mikono yendi yafuile ngue vimpanda via tuhia. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Uakele na livulu lialindende liakuzenga liakufukuka mu livoko liendi. Ualiatele mukono uendi ua cilio ha cisali kaha ukuavo mukono uendi ua cimoshue ha ntunda, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />kaha uatambekele na lizi liakama ngue ndumba ohia. Omo uatambekele, kaha vililimo vitanu na vivali vialumine. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Kaha munima yakuluma vije vililimo vitanu na vivali, njatondele kusoneka vuno honi njovuile lizi kuhuma muilu ngualio, “Niunga mu mutima uove lika vije vivinahandeka vije vililimo vitanu na vivali, kaha keti uvisoneke.” <verse eid="REV 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Ambahoni kangelo uje injamuene nemana ha cisali na ha ntunda uoluele livoko liendi lia cilio muilu, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />kaha ualisingile hali ikeye uje uayoya miaka yoshe ya yaye, uje uatangele lilu na vioshe vije vilimo, na mavu na vioshe vije vilimo, na cisali na vioshe vije vilimo. Kaha uahandekele nguendi, “Ku kukakala naua kusimbula! <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />Vuno honi mu matangua aje omo kangelo uamucitanu na vavali akasika tolombita yendi kaha cisinkiko ca Njambi cikalishulisisa ngue muje mualekele vangamba vendi, tunanguizi.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Ambahoni lizi lije linjovuile kuhuma muilu lia handekele kuli yange naua ngualio, “Ya ukambate lije livulu lia lindende lia kuzenga lia kufukula lije lili mu livoko lia kangelo uje nemana ha cisali na ha ntunda.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Nankuma njaile kuli uje kangelo nakumuleka nguange anjihane lije livulu lia kuzenga lia lindende. Kaha uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Liambate kaha lilie, likashasha mu lizimo liove, vuno honi likapuelelela ngue vuci mu kanua kove.” <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Kaha njanonele lije livulu liakuzenga lia lindende mu livoko lia kangelo na kulilia, lia puelelele ngue vuci mu kanua kange. Vuno honi omo njalilile, liapuile lia kushasha muzimo liange. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Kaha uanjilekele nguendi, “Unapande naua kuambulula vunanguizi ku vantu vavengi na mu mafuti na mu vindaka na ku vimiene.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Vakaleho vavali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Ambahoni vanjihanene citi cije califuile ngue citi cakusetekesa, kaha vanjilekele nguavo, “Ya ukaseteke njivo ya Njambi na mutula na vaje vakalemesela kuje. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Vuno honi keti ukaseteke mbalanda ya njivo ya Njambi. Ije yakaiseze muomu ikeyo vanaihana kuli vaka mafuti, kaha vakaliatangela ha nganda ya kulela ha vingonde makumi auana na vingonde vivali (42) <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Kaha njikahana vakaleho vange vavali nzili yakuambulula vunanguizi ha matangua akupua likulukazi na vihita vivali na matangua makumi atanu na limo (1,260) oku vanazala mu vikeleya.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Ava vakevo ije miti ya olive ivali na vitumbiko via vindeya vivali vije viemana kulutue lua muene ua vaka mavu. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Kaha nga kukakala umo uje akavavulumuna, kaha tuhia tukahuma mutunua tuavo tukanongesa vitozi vavo, nga kukakala umo uje akavavulumuna, kaha kuvakazina zina kumutsiha. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Vali na nzili yakushoka lilu linga kalunga keti anoke ha matangua aje avakambulula vunanguizi vuavo. Kaha vali na nzili ya kutengulula mema linga apue maninga, kaha naua vali na nzili ya kupihisa mavu na tuyando tuoshe kuya muje muvatondelamo.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Kaha omo vanamanesa kuhana vukaleho vuavo, kaha uje cikashama akahumu mu cina cakuhona masima akalinga nzita navo kaha akavahiana na kuvatsiha, <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />kaha vivimbi viavo vakavilangeka mu tapalo ya nganda yakama ije ivatumbuile nguavo Sondoma na Ingito kuje kuvashukikile Muene uavo. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Ha matangua atatu na mbazuvuila ya litangua vamo vakahuma ku vantu voshe, na ku miyati, na ku vindaka, na ku mafuti mukuhilula vivimbi viavo nakuviana linga keti vavatsinde. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Kaha vaka mafuti vaka vuahelela cikuma muomu yavo. Vakalinga viuano na kulihana mavuana muomu ava tunanguizi vavali vayandesele vaka mavu. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Vuno honi munima ya matangua atatu na mbazuvuila ya litangua, muku ua muono uakuhuma kuli Njambi uavakovelele, vemanene kaha na vaje vavamuene vovuile liova. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Ambahoni vovuile lizi liakutambeka kuhuminina muilu lije liahandekele kuli vakevo ngualio, “Ijeni kuno.” Vayile muilu mu lishelua oku vitozi vavo vali nakuvatalelela. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ha ntsimbu ijevene kuakele mandunduma akama kaha mutambela ua vulikumi ua nganda ua siukile. Makulukazi atanu na avali (7,000) a vantu vatsile ku mandunduma. Kaha vaje vayoyeleho vakele na liova cikuma kaha vahanene vumpau kuli Njambi ua muilu.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Kayando kamucivali kanahiti, kaha kamucitatu vuavuno keja.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tolombita ya mucitanu na vivali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Ambahoni kangelo ua mucitanu na vavali uasikile tolombita yendi, kaha muilu muakele mezi akutambakana aje ahandekele nguauo, “Vumuene vua mavu vunapu honi vumuene vua Muene uetu na Kilistu uendi, kaha akayula ya yaye.” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Kaha na vakuluntu vaje makumi avali na vauana vaje vatumama ha matanda avo kulutue lua Njambi, vavulamanene na kulemesa Njambi, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Tuhana vitsantsela kuli yove Muene Njambi Uanzili yoshe, uje aliko na uje uakeleko!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Unambata nzili yove yakama</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">nakuputuka kuyula!<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Vaka mafuti vanienguele cikuma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">vuno honi vutenu vuove vuezile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ha ntsimbu yakusompa vaka kutsa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ya kuhana vuana ku vangamba vove, naku tunanguizi, naku vantu vove vakulela</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nakuli vaje vevuilile liova lizina liove,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">vakama hamo nava vavandende.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Nakunongesa vaje vaka kunongesa mavu!”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ambahoni njivo ya Njambi muilu yashokolokele, na cikasa ca litavasano liendi casholokele mu njivo yendi Njambi. Kaha kuakele kuhiatula ca mihiato, na kumbalanganda, na vililimo na mandunduma na kalunga uakama ua civue.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Mpuevo na Canza Ngombe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Kaha cimueso cakama casholokele muilu. Kuakele mpuevo uje uazalele litangua, na ngonde ku viliato viendi, kaha ha mutue uendi hakele cilongo ca vintanga ntanga likumi na vivali. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Uemitile kaha uakele nakulila mushongo uakusema muomu uatondele kusema.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Ambahoni cimueso cikuavo casholokele muilu. Taleni, kuakele Canza ngombe uakuvenga uje uakele na mitue itanu na ivali na mambinga likumi, kaha ha mutue na mutue hakele cilongo. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Mukila uendi uakombele mutambela ua mucitatu ua vintanga ntanga na kuviumbila ha mavu. Kaha canza ngombe uemanene kulutue lua uje mpuevo uje uatondele kusema linga alie uje kakeke omo asemuka. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Uje mpuevo uasemene muana ua yala, uje akayula mafuti oshe na mbueti ya cikuvo. Vuno honi uje munendi vamutualele kuilu kuli Njambi ku litanda liendi. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Kaha uje mpuevo uateuelelele mu mpambo kuje kuakauanene cihela cije camuvuaheselele Njambi, kuje kuakamuniungila ha matangua akupua likulukazi limolika na vihita vivali na makumi atanu na limo lia matangua (1,260)<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Kaha honi nzita yaputukile muilu. Mingeli na tungelo vendi valuisile canza ngombe, kaha na ikeye ualuile na tungelo vendi, <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />vuno honi uje canza ngombe vamuhianene kaha kakele na cihela naua muilu. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Kaha uje canza ngombe vamumbilile ha mavu, uje linoka ualaja, uje ivatumbula nguavo Liyavolo cipue Satana, uje mukakukuisa mavu oshe. Vamumbilile ha mavu hamolika na tungelo vendi.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Kaha njovuile lizi litambeka muilu ngualio, “Honi kuovoka na nzili na Vumuene vua Njambi yetu na nzili yakama ya Kilistu uendi vineja muomu uje muka kuvangeya vamuanetu vanamumbila ha mavu, uje muka kuvavangeya vutsiki na mutania kuli Njambi yetu. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Kaha vanamuhiana na maninga a Muna Mpanga na lizi lia vusunga lije livambuluile, muomu kuvazangele miono yavo cipue vene ha kutsa. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Nankuma vuahelela yove lilu na voshe vaje vakalamo! Vuno honi tuyando kuli mavu na cisali muomu Liyavolo neja kuli yeni mukuniengua cakama, muomu nazivuka nguendi ntsimbu yendi inapu yaindende.”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Kaha honi omo uje canza ngombe uamuene nguendi vanamumbila ha mavu, kaha uakavele uje mpuevo uje uasemene muana ua yala. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Vuno honi uje mpuevo vamuhanene mambava avali a ngonga uakama linga ateue uje linoka nakupululukila mu mpambo, ku cihela kuje kuvaka muniungila ha miaka itatu na mbazuvuila ya muaka. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Uje canza ngombe uashanjele mema ngue livazi lia ndonga kukava uje mpuevo linga limukupule. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Vuno honi mavu ezile mukukuasa uje mpuevo, mavu ashokoluele kanua kauo kaha aminisile ije ndonga yashanjele uje canza ngombe. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Ambahoni uje canza ngombe uanienguelele uje mpuevo, kaha uayile nakulinga nzita na vana va uje mpuevo vaje vatulika mashiko a Njambi na kutulika vukaleho vua Yesu. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Kaha uje canza ngombe uemanene ha cikuma ca cisali.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Vikashama vavali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Kaha njamuene cikashama ahuma mu cisali. Uje uakele na mambinga likumi na mitue itanu na ivali, ha limbinga na limbinga hakele cilongo kaha na ha mutue na mutue hakele lizina lia kushaula. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Kaha uje cikashama injamuene uafuile ngue ingue, na viliato viendi viafuile ngue via mbeya, na kanua kendi kafuile ngue ka ndumba. Kaha canza ngombe uahanene nzili na litanda na nzili yendi yakama kuli cije cikashama. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Umo ua mitue ya uje cikashama uasholokele ngue vanau vulumuna, vuno honi mbandu yakukanguka. Mavu oshe akomokele kaha akavangeyele uje cikashama. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Vantu valemesele uje canza ngombe muomu ikeye uahanene nzili yendi yakama kuli cikashama. Kaha valemesele uje cikashama nguavo, “Nkuma iya nalifu na cikashama, kaha iya naua asa kuciluisa?”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Kaha uje cikashama vamuhanene kanua kakuhandeka mezi akulihalesa na akushaula, kaha vamuhanene nzili yakama yakupangesa ha vingonde viakupua makumi auana na vingonde vivali (42) <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Cikashama uafukuile kanua kendi mukushaula Njambi, kushaula lizina liendi na cihela cendi cakala, na vaje voshe vakala muilu. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Kaha cikashama vacitavesele kuluisa vantu vakulela va Njambi nakuvahiana. Kaha vacihanene naua nzili yakama ha miyati yoshe na ku vantu voshe, naku vindaka vioshe na mafuti oshe. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Voshe vakala ha mavu vaka cilemesa, voshe vaje mazina avo kuva asonekele tele kanda vatunge luvula lua mavu mu livulu lia muono lia Muna Mpanga uje ivatsihile.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Uoshe uje alina matuitui ovue! <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Nga umo vamukuata vunzinda, cilivene akapua cinzinda, nga umo vamutumbuila kumutsiha na mukuale, cilivene vakamutsiha na mukuale. Eci cikeco kusana ca lukakateya na lutsilielo lua vantu vakulela va Njambi.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Ambahoni njamuene naua cikashama cikuavo cije catuhukile mu mavu. Cakele na mambinga avali ngue Muna Mpanga kaha cakele nakuhandeka ngue canza ngombe. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Capangesele nzili yakama yoshe ya uje cikashama uakulivanga ku mesho endi. Calingisile mavu na vioshe vije viliho linga vilemese uje cikashama uakulivanga, uje mbandu yendi yakangukile. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Calingile vimueso viakama, cipue kupanga tuhia kuhuma muilu kuija hano ha mavu ku mesho a vantu voshe. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Muomu ya vimueso vije vivamutavesele kulinga ku mesho a cikashama uakulivanga, cakuisile vaje vakala ha mavu. Cavashikile linga vapange cifua mukusingimika uje cikashama ivavulumuine na mukuale kaha uayoyele naua. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Uje cikashama uamucivali vamutavesele kuhana muku muli cije cifua ca cikashama ca kulivanga linga cije cifua case kuhandeka na kulingisa voshe vaje kuvalemesa cije cifua ca cikashama linga vavatsihe. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Kaha naua uasindiye vantu voshe, vakama nava vavandende, vakufuka na vihutu, vaka kupatuka na vandungo linga vavahake cimueso ku livoko lia cilio cipue ha luholo, <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />ngeci naumo uahi alanda cipue kulandesa kuvanga uje alina cimueso, cikeco cije lizina lia uje cikashama cipue numelu ya lizina liendi.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Eci vacitumbula mana. Uoshe uje alina mana asa kueseka kuuana kulumbunuka ca numelu ya uje cikashama, muomu ikeyo inapu numelu ya muntu. Numelu yaco ikeyo yapua vihita vitanu na cimo na makumi atanu na limo na vitanu na cimo. (666)<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Muna Mpanga na vantu vendi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Ambahoni njatalele ku Munkinda ua Siyone kuje kuemanene Muna Mpanga, na vantu vakupua 144,000 vaje ha maholo avo vavasonekele lizina liendi neli lia Ishe. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Kaha njevuile lizi liakuhuma muilu lije liafuile ngue kukukuta ca mema ha cipupa na mikalateto ya cililimo cakama. Kaha lije lizi njovuile lialifuile ngue kuohia ca vaka tulialia vaje vemba ha tulialia tuavo, <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />kaha vembile muaso ua uha kulutue lua litanda na tusitu vakuyoya vauana na vakuluntu. Naumo uahi uasele kulilongesa uje muaso kuvanga lika vaje 144,000 vaje vavakulile ha mavu. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Ava vakevo vaje kanda valimone na vampuevo, vakevo ava vakakava Muna Mpanga, kuoshe akaya, ava vanavakulu kuhuma ku miyati yoshe kupua vushuka vuakulivanga vua Njambi na Muna Mpanga, <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />kaha mutunua tuavo kumuahumine makuli, kaha kuvakele na mulonga.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tungelo vatatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Ambahoni njamuene kangelo mukuavo apululuka mu vukambuila, na Muzimbu Uacili uayaye linga akambulule kuli vaje vakala ha mavu, ku mafuti oshe, naku miyati yoshe, na kuvindaka vioshe na ku vantu voshe. <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />Kaha uahandekele na lizi liakutambeka nguendi, “Ivuileni Njambi liova kaha muhaneni vumpau muomu ntsimbu ya kusompa cendi inahete, kaha lemeseni uje uatangele melu na mavu, na cisali na mavuelu vuelu.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Kaha kangelo ua mucivali uakavele uje uakulivanga, uahandekele nguendi, “Nau, nau Mbambilone uakama, uje ualingisile mafuti oshe kunua viniu viendi via vukoyi.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Kaha kangelo uamucitatu uje uakavele vaje vakuavo, uahandekele na lizi liakutambeka nguendi, “Nga uoshe alemesa cikashama na cifua cendi, nakutambula cimueso na kucihaka ha luholo luendi cipue ha livoko liendi, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />naikeye akanua viniu via vutenu vua Njambi, vije ku vashingasanene mu nganja yendi ya vutenu, kaha vakayanda ku tuhia na sulufa ku mesho a tungelo vakulela na ku mesho a Muna Mpanga. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Kaha na vuisi vua tuyando tuavo vukaya muilu ha miaka yoshe, kaha ku vakahuimi vutsiki na mutania, ava vakevo vaka kulemesa cikashama na cifua cendi, kaha nauje uoshe akatambula cimueso ca lizina liendi.”<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Aha hakeho vene hali lukakateya ku vantu vakulela va Njambi, vaje vaka kuniunga mashiko a Njambi na lutsilielo lua Yesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Kaha njovuile lizi lije liahumine muilu ngualio, “Soneka eci: Vakukuisula vatsi vaje vatsila muli Muene kuhuma hano na kutualelaho.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">“Cilivene vakukuisula.” Cimbembesi ahandeka nguendi, “Linga vahuime ku vipangi viavo, muomu vilinga viavo vikavakava!”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuteja ca hano ha mavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Ambahoni njatalele, kaha njamuene lishuela lia kutoka, kaha haje ha lishuela hatumamene uakufua ngue Muna Muntu, na cilongo ca ngolinde ku mutue uendi, na mpoko ya kutejesa ya kuvambuka mu livoko liendi. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Kaha mukuavo kangelo uahumine mu Njivo ya Njambi uasanene uje uatumamene ha lishelua na lizi liakutambeka nguendi, “Ambata mpoko yove ya kutejesa, linga uteje, muomu ntsimbu yakuteja inahete, muomu kuteja ca mavu kunapuho.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Nankuma uje uatumamene ha lishuela uahuingisile mpoko yendi ya kutejesa ha mavu, kaha mavu va atejele.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Kaha mukuavo kangelo uahumine mu Njivo ya Njambi muilu, naikeye naua uakele na mpoko ya kutejesa ya kuvambuka. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Ambahoni kangelo mukuavo uahumine ku mutula, uje kangelo uakele na nzili yakama ha tuhia, kaha uatambekele na lizi liakutambeka kuli uje uakele na mpoko ya kutejesa ya kuvambuka nguendi, “Ambata mpoko yove ya kutejesa, kaha kungulula vushuka vua ku muti ua viniu vuaha mavu, muomu vushuka vuauo vunahi.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Nankuma uje kangelo uahuingisile mpoko yendi ya kutejesa ha mavu nakukungulula vushuka vua ha mavu, nakuvumbila mu cikamuino ca viniu ca vutenu vua Njambi. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Kaha cikamuino ca viniu vacikokelele hambanza ya nganda, kaha maninga a humine mu cikamuino ca viniu, asindumukile ngue vulaha vua muiva uamu kanua ka kavalu uakupua 1,600 kilomita.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Tungelo vaje vakele na tuyando tuakama tua kumanusuila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Ambahoni njamuene cikuavo cimueso muilu cije capuile cakama na kukomouesa, tungelo vatanu na vavali vakele na tuyando tuakama tutanu na tuvali, tuje tuketuo tuamamanusuilo, muomu hali vakevo hakeho hahuila vutenu vua Njambi.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Njamuene cakulifua ngue cisali ca kalivanjelo ca kulipandakana na tuhia, na vaje vahianene cikashama na cifua cendi na numelu ya lizina liendi, vanemana kumukulo ua cisali ca kalivanjelo na tulialia tua Njambi mu mavoko avo. <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Kaha vembile muaso ua Mosesa, ngamba ya Njambi, na muaso ua Muna Mpanga, nguavo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Vukama na kukomouesa kua vilinga viove,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Haaa Muene Njambi Uanzili yoshe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Vingila viove viapua via vusunga na kuhona civembulu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Haaa Muene ua mafuti oshe!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Haa Muene, nkuma iya kasakukuvuila liova</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">na kulemesa lizina liove?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Muomu yove lika uapua uakulela.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Mafuti oshe akeja</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">nakukulemesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">muomu kusompa cove vanacisholola.” <verse eid="REV 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Hanima yevi, njamuene Njivo ya Njambi ya shokoloka muilu ikeyo ije mbalaka ya vukaleho, <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />kaha mu njivo ya Njambi muahumine tungelo vatanu na vavali, na tuyando tuakama tutanu na tuvali, vazalele vintanga viakutoka too via liniu, kaha valikutile miva ya ngolinde ha vintulo viavo. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Kaha umo ua tusitu vakuyoya vauana uahanene vaje tungelo vatanu na vavali malonga a ngolinde atanu na avali a kushula na vutenu vua Njambi uje uayoya miaka yoshe ya yaye. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Kaha Njivo ya Njambi yashulile na vuisi vuaku vumpau vua Njambi naku nzili yendi, kaha naumo uahi uasele kukovela mu njivo ya Njambi kuvanga noho tuyando tuakama tutanu na tuvali tua tungelo vatanu na vavali tuahuile.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Malonga a vutenu vua Njambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Ambahoni njovuile lizi liakutambeka kuhuminina mu njivo ya Njambi lije lialekele tungelo vatanu na vavali ngualio, “Yeni muketile ha mavu malonga atanu na avali a vutenu vua Njambi.”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Nankuma uje kangelo ua kulivanga uayile nakuitila lilonga liendi ha mavu, kaha vimbandu via kukomouesa nakuvavala cikuma viezile hali vamala vaje vakele na cimueso ca uje cikashama nakulemesa cifua cendi.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Kangelo ua mucivali uetilile lilonga liendi mu cisali, kaha cije cisali catengulukile kupua ngue maninga a muntu uakutsa, kaha coshe ca kuyoya mu cisali catsile.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Kangelo ua mucitatu uetilile lilonga liendi mu vindonga na mu mavuelu vuelu, kaha viahimpukile kupua maninga. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Kaha njovuile kangelo uje muka kuendesa mema ahandeka nguendi, “Unasompo muavusunga, yove uliko kaha naua yove uakeleko, Yove Uakulela. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Muomu vantu vanetila maninga a vantu vakulela va Njambi na tunanguizi, kaha unavahana maninga ngeci vanue. Muomu ca vapande!” <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Kaha njovuile mutula uhandeka nguauo, “Yove, Muene Njambi Uanzili yoshe, ua vusunga na kusompa cove capua cakuhona civembulu!”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Kangelo ua mu ciuana uetilile lilonga liendi ha litangua, kaha valitavesele kuuemeka vantu na tuhia, <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />vantu va vatsimikile na ntuima yakukomouesa, kaha vasingile lizina lia Njambi uje uakele na nzili ha tuyando tuakama otu, kaha ku vatengulukile ku vipi viavo nakumuhana vumpau.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Kangelo ua mucitanu uetilile lilonga liendi ha litanda lia cikashama, kaha vumuene vuendi vuakele mu milima, vantu valishumangele vindaka viavo muomu yakuvavala cije vovuile, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />kaha vasingile Njambi ua muilu muomu ya kuvavala cavo na vimbandu, vuno honi kuva tengulukile ku vilinga viavo.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Kangelo ua mucitanu naumo uetilile lilonga liendi mu ndonga yakama ya Yufuleti, kaha mema amuo omine, mukuvuahesa ngila ya vimiene vaje vakahuma mu ngangela. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Kaha njamuene mu kanua ka uje canza ngombe, na mukanua ka uje cikashama, na mukanua ka uje kananguizi ua makuli muahumine vimbembesi via kupihia vitatu viakufua ngue vinjunda, <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />muomu viapua vimbembesi via mahamba, kaha vikalingi vimueso vije vikai ku vimiene vaha mavu oshe, na kuvakungulula mukuli vuahesela nzita ya ha litangua lije liakama lia Njambi Uanzili yoshe.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Taleni! Njija ngue muizi! uakukuisula uje atona, uje naniungu vuzalo vuendi linga keti aye kuakuhona vuzalo ngeci keti akashauke!”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Kaha vakunguluile vaje vimiene ku cihela cije vatumbuile mu Cihevelu nguavo Alamangindone.<verse eid="REV 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Kangelo ua mucitanu na vavali uetilile lilonga liendi mu mpunzi, kaha lizi liakutambeka liahumine ku litanda mu Njivo ya Njambi liahandekele ngualio, “Calingiua!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Kaha kuakele mihiato, na cililimo, na mikalateto na mandunduma akama ha mavu aje ku uakeleko hume havatangelele muntu hano ha mavu. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Ije nganda yakama ya litavuile lutatu, kaha vinganda via mafuti viauile, kaha Njambi uavulukile Mbambilone uakama, nakumunuisa nganja ya vutenu vuendi. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Vinkundu vioshe viateuele, kaha ku kuakele munkinda naua. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Mavue akama, aje alemene ngue peseleso ya cihita, auililile vantu kuhuma muilu, noho vantu vasingile Njambi ha kayando kakama ka kalunga ua civue, muomu kaje kayando kapuile kakama cikuma.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Cikoyi ua kutsimana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ambahoni umo ua tungelo vatanu na vavali uje uakele na malonga atanu na avali uezile na kuhandeka kuli yange nguendi, “Ija, njikakumuese kusompa kua uje cikoyi uakama uakutsimana uje natumama helu lia mema amengi, <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />uje ikeye vimiene va ha mavu vanalingi nendi vupangala, kaha vaje vaka kulinga nendi vupangala vanapende viniu via vukoyi vuendi.” <verse eid="REV 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Kaha uje kangelo uanjambatele mu Cimbembesi na kunjituala mu mpambo, kaha njamuene mpuevo natumama ha cikashama ua kuvenga, cije cashulile na mazina a kushaula, kaha cakele na mitue itanu na ivali na mambinga likumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Uje mpuevo uazalele ntanga ya kuvenguluka neyi yakuvenga, kaha ualicakeyeye na ngolinde na mavue a seho na vusanga vuaseho, oku nakuata nganja ya ngolinde mu livoko liendi ya kushula na viuma via kasauntu, na viuma via mazilo, via ku vupangala vuendi. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Kaha ha luholo luendi vasonekeleho lizina lia cisinkiko nguavo, “Mbambilone uakama vaina ya vikoyi na kasauntu ka hano ha mavu.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Kaha njamuene mpuevo uje uapendele maninga a vantu vakulela va Njambi na maninga a vaje vavatsihile muomu ya Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Omo njamuene uje mpuevo njalikomokelele cikuma. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Vuno honi uje kangelo uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Nkuma vika ualikomokela? Njikakuleka cisinkiko cou mpuevo, na ca cikashama uje ali na mitue itanu na avali na mambinga likumi aje akala nauo. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Cikashama uje iuamuene, keti ikeye, kaha akahuma mu cina cakuhona masima nakuya kukunonga, na vaje vantu vakala ha mavu vaje mazina avo kuvasonekele mu livulu lia muono hume hakutanga ca mavu, vakakomoka omo vakamona cikashama, muomu uakeleko, kaha uahiko, kaha naua akeja.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Aha hakeho hakala mana nakuvuisisa, ije mitue itanu na ivali inapu minkinda itanu na ivali ije uje mpuevo uatumamene, <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />kuli naua vimiene vatanu na vavali, vatanu vanau, umo kuali, mukuavo acili nakuija, omo akeja akakala lika mu kantsimbu kandende. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Cikashama uje uakeleko, uje honi uahiko, uje uamu citanu na vatatu vuno honi na kundama kuli vaje vatanu na vavali, kaha vaya mukunonga.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />“Kaha aje mambinga likumi aje uamuene vanapu vimiene likumi vaje kanda vatambule nzili ya kusuana, vuno honi vatambula nzili yakama kupua ngue vimiene ha ntsimbu imo lika, hamo na cikashama. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Ava valina visinganieka vimo nakuhana nzili yavo na nzili yakama kuli cikashama, <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />vakalinga nzita na Muna Mpanga, kaha Muna Mpanga akavahiana, muomu ikeye uapua Muene ua vimiene na Shukulu ua vashukulu, kaha vaje vali hamo nendi vakevo vaje vavasanene na kuvahangula vaje vakulongua.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Kaha uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Mema aje uamuene, aje cikoyi uatumamene, apua vantu na vivunga na mafuti na vindaka. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Kaha mambinga likumi aje uamuene na uje cikashama vakazinda uje cikoyi, vakamunieka vioshe vije viali navio na kumuseza kuakuhona vuzalo, na kulia ntsitu yendi na kutsimika muvila uendi na tuhia, <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />muomu Njambi nacihaka mu mitima yavo linga valinge visinganieka viendi, mukukala na mana amo na kuhana nzili yavo ya kusuana kuli cikashama kuvanga noho mezi a Njambi akalishulisisa.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />“Kaha uje mpuevo uamuene napu nganda yakama ije iyula vimiene va ha mavu.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Kuua ca Mbambilone</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Kaha munima yevi, njamuene kangelo mukuavo ahuma muilu, hakukala na nzili yakama, mavu aviakumine na vumpau vuendi. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Kaha uasanene na lizi liakutambeka nguendi, “Nau, nau, Mbambilone uakama, nahimpuka cihela ca mahamba, na vimbembesi vioshe via kujuala, na cihela ca tuzila voshe vavapi. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Muomu mafuti oshe ananu viniu via vukoyi vuendi, kaha na vimiene va ha mavu valingile vukoyi nendi, kaha vaka kulandesa va ha mavu vanafuku na vufuko vuendi vua mashungu a mapi.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Ambahoni njovuile lizi likuavo lije liahumine muilu ngualio,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Humeni kuli ikeye, yeni vantu vange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">linga keti mulinge vupi vuendi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">linga keti mukundame ku tuyando tuendi tuakama.<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />Muomu vupi vuendi vualana ngue vulaha vua muilu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">kaha Njambi navuluka vipi viendi.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Mulingeni ngue muje mualingile vakuavo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">mufueteseni luvali ha vije vialingile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">mutsingasaneneni luvali mu nganja ije yatsingasanene.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Ngue kuya muje mualihanene vumpau ikeye vavenia na kuyoya vuyoye vuacili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">honi muhaneni seteko ya tuyando tuakama na kulila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Muomu mu mutima uendi akahandeka nguendi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">‘Yange lisano njatumama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">keti yange ntuluue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">kunjikaliliho.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Nankuma tuyando tuendi tuakama tukeja ha litangua limo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">mishongo, kulila na njala yakama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">kaha vakamutsimika na tuhia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">muomu Muene Njambi ikeye uanzili yoshe uje akamusompa.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Kaha vimiene vahano ha mavu vaje valingile navo vukoyi nakuyoya nendi vuyoye vuacili, vakalila nakutambeka omo vakamona vuisi vuakuuema cendi. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Vakemana kulahako nendi mukuteua tuyando tuendi nakuhandeka nguavo, “Naana! Naana! Nganda yakama, nganda ya nzili, Mbambilone! Kusompa cove cineja mu ntsimbu imo lika.”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Kaha vaka kulandesa va hano ha mavu vaka mulila cikuma na kusikoka, muomu naumo uahi akalanda vufuko vuavo, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />vufuko vua ngolinde, na siliva, na mavue aseho, na vusanga vuaseho, na vintanga via liniu, nevi viakuvenguluka, nevi viakusenena, nevi via kuvenga, nevi via miti yakunika muacili, na vivala via kupanga ha mazo a vanjamba, na via miti ya ndando yakama, na via vunengu, na via vikuvo, na via mavue akutoka akukola, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />na sinamone, na nkundu, na ngongosi ya luengo luacili, na miila, na mazi a luengo luacili, na viniu, na oli, na vunga vua tiliku, na tiliku, na vangombe, na vampanga, na tuvalu, na matemba, na vandungo vikevio vije miono ya vantu. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />“Vushuka vuje vu uatondele kukala navuo mu muono uove vunakuhumu, kaha vije vivuahelesa na vije vifukisa via kuseze, kaha ku ukaviuana naua!” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Vaka kulandesa va vufuko ovu, vaje vauanene vufuko kuhuminina kuli ikeye, vakemana kulahako, mukuteua tuyando tuendi, vakalila na kusikoka cikuma nguavo, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />“Naana! Naana! Nganda yakama ije yazalele mu vintanga via liniu viacili, na via kuvenguluka, na viakuvenga, nakukosa ha viuma viakupanga ha ngolinde, na via mavue a seho, na vusanga vuaseho! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Mu ntsimbu imo lika vufuko vuoshe ovu vunahu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Kaha vantuama voshe va mato na vaka kuendamo na vaka kujavula na voshe vaje vakele nakulandesela ha cisali, vemanene kulahako, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />valilile cikuma omo vamuene vuisi vuakuuema cendi, vahandekele nguavo, “Nkuma nganda muka yasa kulieseka ngue eyi nganda yakama?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Valishuuilile livu ha mitue yavo, omo valilile nakusikoka na kulila cikuma nguavo, “Naana! Naana! Muomu nganda eyi yakama ije voshe vaje vakele na mato akama ku cisali vafukile na vufuko vuendi! Mu ntsimbu imo lika vanaipihisa.”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Jolela hali ikeye, yove melu, joleleni yeni vantu vakulela va Njambi na tunganda, na tunanguizi, muomu Njambi namihana kusompa hali ikeye!<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Ambahoni kangelo ua nzili uambatele livue liakulifua ngue livue liakama liakulolela vunga nakuliumbila mu cisali nakuhandeka nguendi, “Omu mukemo Mbambilone nganda yakama vakaiuisa ha mavu na vutenu, kaha kuvakaiuana naua. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Mutambi uavakakuimba tulialia na vakakuimba vimbendo na matolombita, na vaka kuimba vitolombita kuva kayivuho naua! Naumo uahi muntu muka kupanga via mavoko via muyati uoshe akakalamo naua, kaha na mutambi ua livue liakulolela vunga kuvaka uvuho naua! <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Kaha na ceke ca ndeya kucikatu muli yove naua, na lizi lia shombolua na vavenia vulo kuli kevuika muli yove naua, Muomu vakakulandesa vove vapuile vamala va nzili ha mavu, kaha uakuisile vantu voshe na mantseno ove a makuli.”<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Muli ikeye muakele maninga a tunanguizi na a vantu vakulela va Njambi na voshe vaje vavatsihile hano ha mavu.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Munima yevi njevuile cakulifua ngue lizi lia kutambeka lia vantu vaje vali muilu ngualio, “Haleluya! Kuovoka na vumpau na nzili viakundama kuli Njambi yetu! <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Kusompa cendi capua ca vusunga na kuhona civembulu, nasompo cikoyi uakama cikuma uje uakuisile mavu na vukoyi vuendi, kaha vanamufuetesa maninga a vangamba vendi.” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Vatambakanene naua nguavo, “Haleluya! Vuisi vuahumine hali ikeye vuayile muilu ya yaye.” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Kaha vakuluntu makumi avali na vauana (24) na viakutanga via kuyoya viuana, vauile ha mavu nakulemesa Njambi uje natumama ha litanda nguavo, “Ameni. Haleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ciuano ca vulo vua Muna Mpanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Kaha ha litanda kuahumine lizi ngualio, “Shangazaleni Njambi yetu, yeni voshe vangamba vendi, yeni vaje vamuvuila liova, vavandende neni vakama.” <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Ambahoni njevuile cimo cakulifua ngue lizi lia vantu vavengi, liakufua ngue kukukuta ca mema amengi, liakufua ngue mikalateto ya mihiato ngualio, “Haleluya! Muomu Muene Njambi uetu Uanzili yoshe yakama ayula. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Tujoleleni na kuvuahelela na kumuhana vumpau, muomu ntsimbu inahete ya vulo vua Muna Mpanga, kaha shombolua nalivuahesela laja. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Capuile kapandi ikeye kuzala ntanga ya kutoka too ya liniu.” (Muomu lije liniu lia cili likelio vipangi via vusunga via vantu vakulela va Njambi)<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Kaha kangelo uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Soneka evi, Vakukuisula vaje vavanalania ku ciuano ca vulo vua Muna Mpanga.” Kaha uahandekele kuli yange naua nguendi, “Aua akeuo mezi a vusunga a Njambi.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Ambahoni njauililile kuviliato viendi nakumulemesa, Vuno honi uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Kuuapandele kucilinga! Yange nji ngamba lika ngue yove na kavusamba kove uje uakakateya kuvukaleho vua Yesu. Lemesa Njambi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Muomu vukaleho vua Yesu vunapu cimbembesi ua vunanguizi.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kavalu ua kutoka na muka kulondaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Ambahoni njamuene lilu lia shokoloka, kaha taleni hajevene halutue luange kuakele kavalu uakutoka, kaha uje ualondeleho vamutumbuile nguavo Uakulongua na Vusunga, kusompa cendi na kulua cendi ca ciyulo. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Mesho endi apua ngue mulengi uatuhia, kaha ha mutue uendi nazala vilongo viavingi, kaha ali lizina lia kusoneka lije kuvazivuka voshe kuvanga lika ikeye vavenia. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Nazala vuzalo via kumbuitika mu maninga, kaha na lizina livamusana nalio linapu Lizi lia Njambi. <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Masualale va muilu vaje valondele ha tuvalu vakutoka, vazalele mu liniu lia kutoka too vamukavele. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mukanua kendi kuahumine mukuale ua kuvambuka ukeuo uakanongesa nauo mafuti. Kaha aka vayula na mbueti ya cikuvo, akakamuna viniu mu cikamuino ca viniu ca kuniengua ca vutenu vua Njambi muka Nzili yoshe. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ha cizalo cendi na ha ntumba yendi hakala lizina ngualio, “Shukulu ua vashukulu na Muene ua vimiene.”<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Ambahoni njamuene kangelo nemana ha mutania, na lizi liakutambeka uasanene tuzila voshe vaje vakapululuka ha vukambuila nguendi, “Ijeni mulikungulule hamo ku ciuano cakama ca Njambi, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />linga mulie mivila ya vimiene, na mivila ya vantuama va masualale, na mivila ya vamala vanzili, na mivila ya tuvalu na vaje vaka kulondaho, na mivila ya vantu voshe, vakupatuka na vandungo, na voshe vavandende nava vakama.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Ambahoni njamuene cikashama na vimiene vahano ha mavu na masualale vavo, valikunguluile hamo kulinga nzita nendi, uje ualondele ha kavalu na masualale vendi. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Kaha uje cikashama vamukuatele, hamo nakananguizi uendi ua makuli uje uamulingilileko vimueso, vije viakuisile navio vaje vatambuile cimueso ca uje cikashama na vaje valemesele cifua cendi, vaje vavali vavombilile tele vacili na kuyoya mu cisali ca tuhia tuakushukuma na sulufa. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Vaje vasaleleho vavatsihile na mukuale uje uahumine mukanua ka uje ualondele ha kavalu, kaha tuzila voshe valile mivila yavo ngue muvatondelelemo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Miaka likulukazi (1,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Ambahoni njamuene kangelo uashulukile kuhuminina muilu, mu livoko liendi nakuata sapi ya cina cakuhona masima na lilienge liakama. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Uakuatele canza ngombe linoka ua laja, ikeye Liyavolo cipue Satana, kaha vamukutile miaka ya kupua likulukazi 1,000. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Kaha kangelo uombilile uje canza ngombe mucina cakuhona masima, kaha uashokeleko nakupatako kasateso, linga keti ase kukuisa vantu naua, kuvanga noho miaka likulukazi (1,000) inahiti, munima yevi vakamuzitula muka kantsimbu kakandende lika.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Ambahoni Njamuene matanda, kaha vaje vatumameneho vavahanene nzili yakusompa, njamuene naua miono ya vaje vavatetele mitue muomu vambuluile vusunga vuje vuasholuele Yesu na lizi lia Njambi, navaje kuvalemesele cikashama cipue cifua cendi, kaha kuvatambuile cimueso ha maholo avo cipue ha mavoko avo. Vasangukile kaha vayulile hamo na Kilistu ha miaka likulukazi (1,000) <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Vaka kutsa vaje vasaleleho ku vayoyele naua kuvanga noho miaka ya kupua likulukazi 1,000 inahiti, eci cikeco kusanguka cakulivanga. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Uakukuisula na kulela uje akakala na mutambela kukusanguka ca kulivanga, nankuma kutsa ca mucivali kucesi nanzili hali vakevo, vuno honi vakapua vasasendote va Njambi na Kilistu, kaha vaka yula nendi miaka ya kupua likulukazi (1,000)<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satana vamuhiana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Munima ya miaka likulukazi (1,000), Satana vaka muzitula mukamenga. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Kaha akeja mukukuisa mafuti aje ali mu vimbango viuana via mavu, akeo Ngonge na Mangonge kuvakunguluila ku nzita, numelu yavo yapua ngue museke seke uaku cisali. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Kaha vendanganene mavu oshe na kuzenguluka cilombo ca vantu vakulela va Njambi nganda ivazanga, vuno honi tuhia tuahumine muilu na kuvanongesa. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Na Liyavolo uje uavakuisile naikeye vamumbilile mu cisali ca tuhia na Sulufa, muje muakele cikashama na kananguizi ua makuli, kaha vakayanda vutsiki na mutania ya yaye.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusompa ca mamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Ambahoni njamuene litanda liakama lia kutoka na uje uatumamaho, kaha mavu na lilu liateuele hamesho endi, kaha kuviakele na cihela naua. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Kaha njamuene vaka kutsa, vakama nava vavandende vanemana ha lutue lua litanda na mavulu akushokolola, kaha na livulu lieka valishokuelele, likelio livulu lia muono. na vaka kutsa va vasompele kuya namuje muvana sonekela mu mavulu, kuya kuvilinga viavo viva lingile. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Na cisali cahanene vaka kutsa vaje vakele muli cikeco, Vutsi na Vukalo vua vatsi vuahanene vaka kutsa vaje vakele muli vikevio, kaha muntu na muntu vamusompele kuya ku vilinga viendi. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Ambahoni Vutsi na Vukalo vua vatsi va vuimbilile mu cisali ca tuhia. Kaha cisali ca tuhia cikeco kutsa ca mucivali. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Nga muntu uoshe lizina liendi kuvalisonekele mu livulu lia muono, vaka mumbila mu cisali ca tuhia.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Lilu lia liha na mavu a maha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Ambahoni njamuene lilu lia liha na mavu a maha. Muomu lilu liakulivanga na mavu a kulivanga vinahiti, na cisali kucakeleko naua. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Kaha njamuene nganda yakulela, Yelusalema yaiha, ije ili nakuija kuhuma muilu kuli Njambi, ije inalivuahesela ngue shombolua uje nalipesa pesela yaliendi. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Kaha njevuile lizi litambeka kuhuma ha litanda ngualio, “Taleni, mbalaka ya Njambi ili hamo na vantu. Akakala hamo navo, kaha vakapua vantu vendi, na Njambi vavenia akakala hamo navo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Akahunda masozi oshe ku mesho avo, kaha kutsa kucikakalako naua, cipue vusiua, cipue kulila, cipue kuvua kuvavala, muomu viuma vioshe via laja vinahiti.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Kaha uje uatumama ha litanda uahandekele nguendi, “Taleni, Njikalinga viuma vioshe vipue via viha.” naua uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Soneka evi, muomu aua mezi apua a kukonkama na vusunga.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Kaha uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Calingiua! Yange Alufa na Omenga, maputukilo na mamanusuilo. Kaha kuli vaje voshe valinampuila njikavahana mema a kunua a mu livuelu vuelu lia mema a muono cakuhona fueto. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Uje akahiana akasuana viuma vioshe, njikapua Njambi yendi, kaha na ikeye akapua munange. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Vuno honi vaka liova, na vaka kuhona lutsilielo, na vakakulinga via vuniengue, na vaka kutsiha na vaka vupangala, na vaka mantseno na vaka kulemesa tumponia na vaka makuli, cihela cavo cikapua mu cisali cakuuema na tuhia na sulufa, cikeco kutsa ca mucivali.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yelusalema yaiha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Ambahoni umo ua vaje tungelo vatanu na vavali vaje vakele na malonga atanu na avali akushula na tuyando tuakama tutanu na tuvali tuakumanusuila, uezile kuli yange nakuhandeka nguendi, “Ija kuno, njikakumuesa Shombolua, mpuevo ya Muna Mpanga.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Kaha uanjambatele mu cimbembesi na kunjituala ku munkinda uakama ualaha, uanjimuesele Yelusalema, Nganda Yakulela, ije yahumine muilu kuli Njambi, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />kaha yakele na vumpau vua Njambi. Nganda ije ya viazimine ngue livue lia seho cikuma, ngue livue lia Njasipa, lia kutungukua ngue kilisitale. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Yakele na civumbe cakama calaha, na vikolo likumi na vivali, kaha tungelo likumi na vavali vaniungile kuje kuvikolo. Kaha haje ha vikolo vasonekeleho mazina likumi na avali a miyati ya vantu Vaisaleli. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Kumutambela umo na umo kuakele vikolo vitatu, ku ngangela vikolo vitatu, na mu kunto vikolo vitatu, namu mbuela vikolo vitatu, na mu kangombe kayambi vikolo vitatu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Kaha civumbe ca nganda cakele na mavula likumi na avali, na ha mavula hakele mazina likumi na avali a tunganda va Muna Mpanga. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Kaha nauje kangelo uahandekele kuli yange uakele na mbueti yakusetekesa ya ngolinde, linga a seteke nganda na vikolo viayo na vivumbe viayo. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Kaha ije nganda yakele na vimbango viuana, seteko yavio muvulaha na mu vuihi vioshe viapuile hamo. Uasetekele ije nganda na mbueti yendi yakusetekesa, yapuile makilomita 2,200 mu vulaha na mu vuihi namukulaha kuayo. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Uje kangelo naua uasetekele civumbe cayo cije capuile mamita makumi atanu na limo na atanu (65) kuya mukuseteka ca muntu. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Cije civumbe vacitungile na mavue a njasipa, na ije nganda vaitungile na mavue a ngolinde a kuviakuma ngue kalivanjelo. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Mavula a civumbe ca nganda va apesa pesele na miyati yoshe ya mavue a seho. Cakulivanga capuile livue lia njasipa, ca mucivali capuile safile, ca mucitatu capuile angeta, ca muciuana capuile emalinde, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />camucitanu capuile onikisi, ca mucitanu na cimo capuile kanelia, ca mucitanu na vivali capuile kuataze, ca mucitanu na vitatu capuile mbelilu, ca mucitanu na viuana capuile topaze, ca vulikumi capuile kalesendoni, cavulikumi na cimo capuile takuoise, cavulikumi na vivali capuile emesita. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Kaha navije vikolo likumi na vivali viapuile via vusanga vuaseho likumi na vuvali, cikolo cimo na cimo vacipangele ha vusanga vumo, na tapalo ya nganda vaipangele ha ngolinde ya cili, yakutungukua ngue kalivangelo.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Kaha kunjamuene cipue imo njivo ya Njambi mu nganda, muomu njivo ya Njambi yayo yapua Muene Njambi uanzili yoshe na Muna Mpanga. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Muje mu nganda kumuatondekele kutua ca litangua cipue ngonde, muomu vumpau vua Njambi vukevuo ceke cayo, na Muna Mpanga ikeye ndeya yamuo. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Mafuti oshe akenda ha ceke camuo, kaha vimiene vaha mavu vakahana vumpau vuavo kuli ikeyo. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Vikolo viayo kuvaka vishoko litangua ku litangua, na vutsiki kuvukakalamo muje. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Muje mu nganda vakanehamo vumpau na kasingimiko via mu mafuti. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Vuno honi kukuesi cuma cakujuala cikakovelamo muje mu nganda, cipue uoshe uje akalingi via kasauntu cipue muka makuli kakakovelamo, vuno honi kuvanga lika vaje vavanasoneka mu livulu lia muono lia Muna Mpanga.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s">Ndonga ya Muono</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Ambahoni uanjimuesele ndonga ya mema a muono, yakuviakuma ngue kilisitale, yahumine ku litanda lia Njambi na kuli Muna Mpanga <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />yahitile mukati ka tapalo ya nganda. Kaha sinia na sinia lia ndonga kuakele muti ua muono uje uakele na vushuka likumi na vuvali, uakele na kuima ku ngonde na ngonde, kaha na maputa auo apuile vumbanda vuakukanguisa mafuti. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Kukukakala naua cimo cakusinga, vuno honi litanda lia Njambi na lia Muna Mpanga likakala mu likelio, na vangamba vendi vakamulemesa. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Vakamona cihanga cendi, kaha na lizina liendi likakala ha maholo avo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Kukukakala naua vutsiki, kuvakatondoho naua ceke ca ndeya cipue litangua muomu Muene Njambi akapua ceke cavo kaha vakayula ya yaye.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuija ca Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Kaha kangelo uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Mezi aua anapu a kukonkama na vusunga. Kaha Muene Njambi ua vimbembesi via tunanguizi natumu kangelo kendi linga amuese va ngamba yendi vije vikasholoka vuavuno.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Taleni! Njilinakuija vuavuno.” Vakukuisula vaje vaniunga mezi a vunanguizi vua livulu eli.<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Yange Yiuano, yange vene njovuile na kumona viuma evi. Kaha omo njaviuvuile na kuvimona, njauililile ku viliato via uje kangelo uje uanjimueselevio mukumulemesa. <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />Vuno honi uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Keti ucilinge eci! Muomu nange njinapu ngamba ngue yove na vamuanoko tunanguizi hamo na vaje vaniunga mezi a livulu eli. Lemesa Njambi!” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Kaha uahandekele kuli yange nguendi, “Keti usinkike aua mezi a vunanguizi a livulu eli, muomu ntsimbu ili muyehi. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Eceleni vaka kulinga vipi vatualeleleho kulinga vipi, na vaka kulinga via vuniengue vatualeleleho kulinga vuniengue, kaha na vaka kulinga via vusunga vatualeleleho kulinga vusunga, na vaka kulela vatualeleleho kulela.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Taleni! Njili nakuija vuavuno, mukuneha vuana vuange mukufueta muntu na muntu ngue kuya kuvipangi viendi vianalingi. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Yange Alufa na Omenga, maputukilo na kukotokela, mbangelo na mamanusuilo.<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />“Vakukuisula vaje vakusha tuzaku tuavo, vakakala nakapandi ku muti ua muono nakukovela mu nganda kulikuasesa vikolo. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Vuno honi hambanza hali tutali na vaka mantseno, na vaka vupangala, na vaka kutsiha, na vaka kulemesa tumponia, na voshe vaje vazanga kulinga via makuli.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Yange Yesu njinatumu kangelo kange kuli yeni na vukaleho ovu ku vikungulukilo. Yange Muzi na mutekuluila ua Ndaviti, ntanga ntanga yakuviakuma ya cimene.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />Cimbembesi na Shombolua vahandeka nguavo, “Ija!” Kaha uoshe uje evua ahandeka nguendi “Ija.” Kaha uoshe uje ali na mpuila eje, na uoshe uje a shunguiya atambule mema a muono cakuhona fueto.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamanusuilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Njinangula uoshe uje evua mezi a vunanguizi a livulu eli, nguange nga muntu a vuezelelako cuma cimo ku mezi aua, na Njambi a kamuvuezelela kuli ikeye tuyando tuakama tuje tuvanasoneka mu livulu eli, <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />nga kukakala umo a kahumisa ku mezi a mu livulu eli lia vunanguizi, Njambi a kamunieka mbazuvuila yendi ya ku muti ua muono na ya mu nganda ya kulela vije vivanasoneka mu livulu eli.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Uje ahana vukaleho viuma evi nguendi, “Muavusunga vene njilinakuija vuavuno.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Ameni. Ija, Muene Yesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Kavumbi ka Muene Yesu kakale neni voshe vantu vakulela va Njambi. Ameni.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>